# Rabbit Response: the scry is conditional on "a Rabbit". Bot1's Chance-Met Elves (an Elf Warrior, 3/2) and Ornithopter are
# pumped to 5/3 and 2/3 but Bot1 controls no Rabbit, so nothing is scried and the Elves' "whenever you scry" gets no counter.
# The Rabbit Warren Elder is Bot2's, which "you control" does not count (CR 701.22a, 608.2c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Chance-Met Elves
Ornithopter
Rabbit Response
Swamp
Mountain
Forest
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Warren Elder
Island x17

